    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im in my garden and just stabbed my foot pretty good with an old rusty trowel. its a deep puncture so im a bit worried but i really dont want to go to the er if i dont have to. can i just soak it in peroxide and put some ointment on it and be fine?",
